$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: (12)
(1R,3R,4R,5R)-5,6-Diamino-3,4-O-isopropylidene-7-aza-2-oxabicyclo[3.3.0]oct-6-ene
(8). To a solution of compound 2 (0.20 g, 0.85 mmol) in 10 mL of THF-H2O
(4:1) was added 0.25 g (0.93 mmol) of PPh3. After stirring overnight at
r.t., the reaction mixture was evaporated and extracted with Et2O and
H2O. The aqueous layer was evaporated to give product. Compound 13, yield
77%.
