2.02 (m, 3H, sCH2s and sCHs), 0.98-0.90 (m, 6H, 2 CH3). 13C NMR (100.6
MHz, CDCl3): 173.2, 138.4, 138.3, 137.6, 128.8, 128.5, 128.4, 128.3,
