11H), 6.15 (br, 1H, NH), 5.59 (br, 1H, NH), 5.51 (s, 1H, benzylidene),
5.25 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 1H, H-1), 4.67 (dt, J = 4.0, 6.8 Hz, 1H, α-H of
Asp), 4.59 (dd, J = 10.0, 8.8 Hz, 1H, H-3), 4.41-4.31 (m, 3H, Fmoc-CH2
and H-5), 4.21-4.19 (m, 2H, Fmoc-CH and H-2), 3.91 (d, J = 5.6 Hz, 2H,
α-H of Gly), 3.87 (d, J = 5.6 Hz, 2H, α-H of Gly), 3.79-3.71 (m, 2H, H-6
and linker-H), 3.64 (s, 3H, Me), 3.62-3.58 (m, 3H, H-4, H-6, linker-H),
3.29-3.26 (m, 2H, linker-H), 2.73 (br, 1H, OH), 2.59 (dd, J = 15.2, 3.2
Hz, 1H, β-H of Asp), 2.36 (dd, J = 15.2, 2.8 Hz, 1H, β-H of Asp); FAB
