$DATUM bicyclo[1.1.1]pentan-1-amine hydrochloride (1). To neat
1-azido-3-iodobicyclo[1.1.1]pentane (2) (100 mg, 0.425 mmol) was added
TTMSS (509 μL, 1.66 mmol), and the resulting mixture was stirred for 15
min where complete consumption of 2 by 1H NMR was observed. The reaction
was washed with cold saturated bicarbonate and the organics extracted
with THF (1.5 mL). To this THF organic layer was added 6 N HCl (1.5 mL)
and triphenylphosphine (223 mg, 0.85 mmol), then allowed to stir
vigorously at rt for 3 h. The water layer was washed with EtOAc (1 mL ×
2) and fully evaporated to dryness. This yellow residue obtained was
triturated with EtOAc followed by DCM. 1 (HCl salt, 35.5 mg, 70%) as an
offwhite solid. *1H NMR (400 MHz, CD3OD) δ 2.66 (s, 1H), 2.11 (s, 6H)
ppm. *13C NMR (101 MHz, CD3OD) δ 52.4, 46.8, 24.5 ppm. 1H NMR (600 MHz,
D2O) δ 2.66 (s, 1H), 2.10 (s, 6H) ppm. 13C NMR (151 MHz, D2O) δ 50.9,
44.9, 23.3 ppm. [lit.4 1H NMR (600 MHz, D2O) δ 2.60 (s, 1H), 2.04 (s, 6H)
ppm. 13C NMR (151 MHz, D2O) δ 53.62, 47.64, 25.94 ppm.] 1H NMR (400 MHz,
DMSO-d 6) δ 2.58 (s, 1H), 1.97 (s, 6H) ppm. 13C NMR (101 MHz, DMSO-d 6) δ
51.2, 45.7, 23.6 ppm. [lit.4 1H NMR (600 MHz, DMSO-d 6) δ 8.97 (br, s,
3H), 2.57 (s, 1H), 1.97 (s, 6H) ppm. 13C NMR (151 MHz, DMSO-d 6) δ 51.08,
45.53, 23.74 ppm.] HRMS (ESI TOF, m/z): [M+Na]+ Calcd for C5H10NNa m/z
142.0394; Found 142.0394. [lit.4 DSC Normalized thermal potential
exotherm: 2015 J/g; Onset temperature: 193°C.] *NMR spectra of 1 (HCl
salt) have not been reported in CD3OD. For spectra, see S16.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM no solvent (stage 1)
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
