$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of 2-[(3-carboxypropanoyl)amino]ethyl
2-acetamido-2-deoxy–β–D–glucopyranoside by the Staudinger ligation 18.
2-Azidoethyl 2-acetamido-2-deoxy–β–D–glucopyranoside (47 mg, 1.6 μmol)
and borane-phosphine complex reagent (116.8 mg, 3.2 μmol) were dissolved
in a CH3CN/H2O (6:1) (1.7 mL). DABCO (36 mg, 3.2 μmol) was then added in
one portion and the mixture was stirred at 45°C temperature for 2 h. The
crude reaction mixture was then concentrated under reduced pressure. The
residue was dissolved in CHCl3/H2O (1:1), centrifugated and the
supernatant freeze-dried. The residue was finally purified by RP-HPLC
(gradient: 0-5% B over 15 min then iscratic), to give the title compound
(49 mg, 80%), after freeze-drying as an oil: oil:[α]D - 48 (c 0.4, H2O),
1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6 ) δ 11.8 (br s, 1 H), 7.68 (t, 1 H, J = 4.8 Hz),
7.67 (d, 1 H, J = 8.8 Hz), 4.30 (d, 1 H, J = 8.4 Hz), 3.73-3.35 (m, 5 H),
3.28 (dd, 1 H, J = 8.0 and 10.0 Hz), 3.23-3.08 (m, 3 H), 3.05 (dd, 1 H, J
= 8.9 and 10.0 Hz) 2.20 (t, 2 H, J = 7.4 Hz), 2.10 (t, 2 H, J = 7.4 Hz),
1.70 (q, 2 H, J = 7.4 Hz); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 175.0, 172.6,
170.1, 101.9 (C1), 77.9 (C4), 75.3 (C3), 71.5 (C5), 68.0 (C6), 61.9
(CH2), 56.2 (C5), 39.5 (CH2), 35.2 (CH2), 33.9 (CH2), 21.5 (CH2);
positive FAB-MS: m/z 1087 [M + K]+, 1072 [M + Na]+; HRMS (FAB) calcd for
[M+Na]+ 1072.4173, found 1072.4206.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM On the Preparation of Carbohydrate-Protein Conjugates Using the Traceless
Staudinger Ligation
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Grandjean, Cyrille; Boutonnier, Alain; Guerreiro, Catherine; Fournier,
Jean-Michel; Mulard, Laurence A.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2005), 70(18), 7123-7132

$RFMT $RIREG SCHEME455 STEP1
